{"id":"f6dfa3af0b7ff312","group":"93","path":"93/93-df-centroid.md","title":"Centroid","display":"df-centroid — Centroid","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Algebraizable Logics","book_abbrev":"93","label":"93-df-centroid","aliases":["93-df-centroid"],"display":"df-centroid — Centroid","depends_on":["[[93-df-lattice]]","[[93-df-distributive]]","[[93-df-bounded-distributive-lattice]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Algebraizable Logics"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"93"},{"key":"label","html":"93-df-centroid"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>93-df-centroid</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-centroid — Centroid"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"3b5f38bd115ed203\" href=\"?note=3b5f38bd115ed203\" title=\"93-df-lattice\">93-df-lattice</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"ba4d7ca4d35e9c4d\" href=\"?note=ba4d7ca4d35e9c4d\" title=\"93-df-distributive\">93-df-distributive</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"0454a0272a142daa\" href=\"?note=0454a0272a142daa\" title=\"93-df-bounded-distributive-lattice\">93-df-bounded-distributive-lattice</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf L\">\\(\\mathbf L\\)</span> is a bounded-lattice candidate and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{BoundedLat}_{93}\">\\(\\mathrm{BoundedLat}_{93}\\)</span> is the predicate of <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"0454a0272a142daa\" href=\"?note=0454a0272a142daa\" title=\"93-df-bounded-distributive-lattice\">93-df-bounded-distributive-lattice</a>.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{DistLat}\">\\(\\mathrm{DistLat}\\)</span> is the distributive-lattice class of <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"ba4d7ca4d35e9c4d\" href=\"?note=ba4d7ca4d35e9c4d\" title=\"93-df-distributive\">93-df-distributive</a>.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{SgLat}_{\\mathbf L}\">\\(\\operatorname{SgLat}_{\\mathbf L}\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Neutral}_{93}\">\\(\\mathrm{Neutral}_{93}\\)</span>, and the legacy-named set <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Cent}_{93}\">\\(\\mathrm{Cent}_{93}\\)</span> are defined here.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}centroid}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{SgLat}_{\\mathbf L}(U)\\coloneqq\n\\bigcap\\Bigl\\{S\\subseteq|\\mathbf L|:U\\subseteq S\n\\land\\forall a,b\\in S\\;(a\\wedge^{\\mathbf L}b\\in S\n\\land a\\vee^{\\mathbf L}b\\in S)\\Bigr\\}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}centroid}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{SgLat}_{\\mathbf L}(U)\\coloneqq\n\\bigcap\\Bigl\\{S\\subseteq|\\mathbf L|:U\\subseteq S\n\\land\\forall a,b\\in S\\;(a\\wedge^{\\mathbf L}b\\in S\n\\land a\\vee^{\\mathbf L}b\\in S)\\Bigr\\}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}centroid}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Neutral}_{93}(c,\\mathbf L)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{BoundedLat}_{93}(\\mathbf L)\\land c\\in|\\mathbf L|\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall x,y\\in|\\mathbf L|\\;\\Bigl(\n\\left\\langle \\operatorname{SgLat}_{\\mathbf L}(\\{c,x,y\\}),\n\\wedge^{\\mathbf L}\\!\\upharpoonright\\operatorname{SgLat}_{\\mathbf L}(\\{c,x,y\\})^2,\n\\vee^{\\mathbf L}\\!\\upharpoonright\\operatorname{SgLat}_{\\mathbf L}(\\{c,x,y\\})^2\\right\\rangle\n\\in\\mathrm{DistLat}\\Bigr),\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}centroid}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Neutral}_{93}(c,\\mathbf L)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{BoundedLat}_{93}(\\mathbf L)\\land c\\in|\\mathbf L|\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall x,y\\in|\\mathbf L|\\;\\Bigl(\n\\left\\langle \\operatorname{SgLat}_{\\mathbf L}(\\{c,x,y\\}),\n\\wedge^{\\mathbf L}\\!\\upharpoonright\\operatorname{SgLat}_{\\mathbf L}(\\{c,x,y\\})^2,\n\\vee^{\\mathbf L}\\!\\upharpoonright\\operatorname{SgLat}_{\\mathbf L}(\\{c,x,y\\})^2\\right\\rangle\n\\in\\mathrm{DistLat}\\Bigr),\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}centroid}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Cent}_{93}(\\mathbf L)\\coloneqq\n\\Bigl\\{c\\in|\\mathbf L|:\\mathrm{Neutral}_{93}(c,\\mathbf L)\n\\land\\exists d\\in|\\mathbf L|\\;(c\\wedge^{\\mathbf L}d=0^{\\mathbf L}\n\\land c\\vee^{\\mathbf L}d=1^{\\mathbf L})\\Bigr\\}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}centroid}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Cent}_{93}(\\mathbf L)\\coloneqq\n\\Bigl\\{c\\in|\\mathbf L|:\\mathrm{Neutral}_{93}(c,\\mathbf L)\n\\land\\exists d\\in|\\mathbf L|\\;(c\\wedge^{\\mathbf L}d=0^{\\mathbf L}\n\\land c\\vee^{\\mathbf L}d=1^{\\mathbf L})\\Bigr\\}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><code>centroid</code> is retained as the directory's legacy label. Generated sublattices, restricted operations, bounds, and carrier membership are now all explicit.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"93-df-lattice","status":"resolved","id":"3b5f38bd115ed203","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[93-df-lattice]]","embed":false},{"target":"93-df-distributive","status":"resolved","id":"ba4d7ca4d35e9c4d"